{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20267bwA1hsE4b1793024874.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美股三大指數全線高開，道瓊斯工業平均指數早段升逾200點。</p><p></p><p>道指經過上周五急挫逾600點後，周一曾經反彈約250點，迫近52,500點水平。納斯達克指數亦向好，早段升逾100點，重上26,000點水平。</p><p></p><p>晶片股造好，輝達、美光科技和閃迪升約百分之2至3。計劃進行股本融資，集資最多950億美元的Meta，股價則跌約百分之1。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:21:10.492253+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T14:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T07:58:16.551496+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:18:21.152191+00:00","content_hash":"6e6fd0ae120d9d89c8d841980057a14c32e2cbb8f8b12fa3c7f7e1871673dadb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:21:10.492253+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}